// Windows resource script for scene-editor.exe.
//
// Ships a single ICON resource. Two consumers pull it in different
// ways:
//   1. Explorer / taskbar / Alt-Tab file icon: the Windows loader
//      picks the ICON resource with the lowest numeric id, so we
//      define IDI_APP as a small integer.
//   2. Live window (title bar + running-taskbar entry): EditorApp
//      does LoadIcon(MAKEINTRESOURCE(IDI_APP)) + WM_SETICON. The
//      integer id must match this file's -- we keep it a #define
//      so both TUs read the same value without dragging in a
//      shared header from the engine side.

#define IDI_APP 101
IDI_APP ICON "scene-editor.ico"
